	(descr "Murata MM8130-2600 (SWF) coaxial switch connector, 2.5 x 2.5 mm, DC-6 GHz. Land and stencil from spec NMM04-PW0001E rev E (figures 2 and 3). Pad 1 = IN (the side the probe connects to), pad 2 = OUT (disconnected when the probe is inserted). The footprint is symmetric, so the part's orientation at assembly decides which side the probe sees. Route both signal pads as 50 ohm.")
